Package: net-watch-pro
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Net Watch Pro <maintainers@netwatchpro.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/zvirox/net-watch-pro
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-37 | libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, librsvg2-2
Description: Local network-traffic monitor and per-app usage tracker
 Net Watch Pro observes traffic on this device and records per-application
 data usage with searchable local history. The root daemon exposes a
 localhost peer-credential Unix socket API to an unprivileged desktop UI.
 .
 Free tier: live view, per-app usage, 90-day history, budgets and alerts.
 Pro (offline license key): advanced filters, CSV/JSON export and 365-day
 retention.
 .
 No telemetry, no analytics, no update pings, no outbound connections.
